tsani and I threw together three words that I think are rather nice, but
that you might not find on search, even though I gave them gloss words,
because they don't really have direct English counterparts. They are:
http://jbovlaste.lojban.org/dict/clatre
http://jbovlaste.lojban.org/dict/gantre
http://jbovlaste.lojban.org/dict/tsutre

I'll mention in advance that I do have a reason why to use these instead of
{nilcla} and its counterparts, but would rather not trigger that whole
discussion here.

